WEBVTT

00:00:01.020 --> 00:00:10.370
残酷死の承知

00:02:01.500 --> 00:02:03.430
"The war has begun."

00:02:03.430 --> 00:02:24.180
"I can't believe I'm losing sight of it at a time like this."

00:02:24.180 --> 00:02:25.570
"I'm in trouble."

00:02:34.600 --> 00:02:36.590
It's not working.

00:02:36.590 --> 00:02:41.890
I knew he wouldn't come.

00:02:41.890 --> 00:02:46.030
I can't wait.

00:02:46.030 --> 00:02:47.780
I can't help it.

00:02:47.780 --> 00:02:48.850
Let's go to the shelter.

00:03:24.280 --> 00:03:25.700
It's been 15 years, hasn't it?

00:03:25.980 --> 00:03:27.580
Yeah, no doubt about it.

00:03:29.190 --> 00:03:29.890
It's a human.

00:04:04.220 --> 00:04:05.120
Sorry to keep you waiting.

00:04:30.000 --> 00:04:31.120
It's an all-out battle!

00:04:31.120 --> 00:04:33.110
Give me Atsugi and Iruma as well!

00:04:33.110 --> 00:04:34.570
There's no need to push forward!

00:04:34.570 --> 00:04:36.530
We have to destroy the target somehow!

00:04:36.530 --> 00:04:54.740
The tank squadron has been destroyed.

00:04:54.740 --> 00:04:57.890
Both the guided weapon and the cannon bomb are of no effect at all!

00:04:57.890 --> 00:04:58.750
It's no good!

00:04:58.750 --> 00:05:00.000
With this much firepower...

00:05:00.090 --> 00:05:02.230
It's the AT field, isn't it?

00:05:02.230 --> 00:05:06.190
It's useless against normal weapons.

00:05:06.190 --> 00:05:10.660
Understood.

00:05:10.660 --> 00:05:12.480
I'll activate it as planned.

00:05:12.480 --> 00:05:21.410
Use the N2 Jiraiya!

00:05:48.840 --> 00:05:51.730
Unfortunately, it seems that you guys didn't have a chance to come out.

00:05:51.730 --> 00:05:52.930
That's right.

00:05:52.930 --> 00:05:56.440
Are you okay?

00:05:56.440 --> 00:05:57.340
Yeah.

00:05:57.340 --> 00:06:00.000
My mouth is tingling.

00:06:00.000 --> 00:06:01.460
That's not too bad.

00:06:01.460 --> 00:06:04.220
Then, let's go.

00:06:04.220 --> 00:06:06.000
Ready, go!

00:06:14.600 --> 00:06:15.690
Thank you very much.

00:06:15.690 --> 00:06:16.750
You saved me.

00:06:16.750 --> 00:06:18.760
No, it's my fault.

00:06:18.760 --> 00:06:20.010
Katsudake-san...

00:06:20.010 --> 00:06:22.330
Misato is fine.

00:06:22.330 --> 00:06:24.550
Please take care of her.

00:06:24.550 --> 00:06:26.260
Ikari Shinji-kun.

00:06:26.260 --> 00:06:27.180
Yes.

00:06:27.180 --> 00:06:28.040
After that...

00:06:28.040 --> 00:06:29.980
For the sake of my life.

00:06:31.790 --> 00:06:34.260
It's that explosion. There's a kick to it.

00:06:34.260 --> 00:06:36.210
Sensor recovery.

00:06:36.210 --> 00:06:40.310
What?!

00:06:40.310 --> 00:06:41.910
Video recovery.

00:06:41.910 --> 00:06:45.060
Where is it?

00:06:45.060 --> 00:06:48.150
It's our trump card.

00:06:48.150 --> 00:06:51.000
What does that mean?

00:06:51.000 --> 00:06:52.660
You monster!

00:07:04.000 --> 00:07:07.810
Don't worry. He's in the top priority.

00:07:07.810 --> 00:07:09.710
So, prepare a cart lane.

00:07:09.710 --> 00:07:11.770
A straight one.

00:07:11.770 --> 00:07:13.030
Yes.

00:07:13.030 --> 00:07:20.700
I said I'd go pick you up, so I'll take full responsibility.

00:07:20.700 --> 00:07:27.390
I'm the worst. I just restored it, but it's already broken.

00:07:27.390 --> 00:07:30.000
33 more loans, plus repairs.

00:07:30.090 --> 00:07:33.090
Plus, I have to wear the same clothes as Chora.

00:07:33.090 --> 00:07:34.590
Um, Misato-san.

00:07:34.590 --> 00:07:36.090
I've put a lot of effort into it.

00:07:37.410 --> 00:07:38.860
Um, Misato-san.

00:07:38.860 --> 00:07:40.310
What?

00:07:40.310 --> 00:07:43.270
Are you sure you want to do something like this?

00:07:43.270 --> 00:07:46.040
Ah, no problem, no problem.

00:07:46.040 --> 00:07:49.940
It's an emergency right now, so I have to move the car.

00:07:49.940 --> 00:07:53.400
Besides, even if I look like this, I'm an international civil servant.

00:07:53.400 --> 00:07:54.750
Banji is okay.

00:07:54.750 --> 00:07:58.680
It's an excuse to be persuasive.

00:08:00.000 --> 00:08:03.520
You look pretty, and you're actually pretty calm.

00:08:03.520 --> 00:08:05.110
Is that so?

00:08:05.110 --> 00:08:06.910
Huh? Are you angry?

00:08:06.910 --> 00:08:11.350
I'm sorry, I'm sorry. I'm a boy, after all.

00:08:11.350 --> 00:08:14.320
Nisato-san sure is a childlike person, given her age.

00:08:15.510 --> 00:08:23.660
As expected, she's recovering from an accident.

00:08:23.660 --> 00:08:27.460
If that's not the case, she'll be useful as a single weapon.

00:08:30.190 --> 00:08:32.740
Oh, it's a big thing.

00:08:32.740 --> 00:08:35.270
Can you even increase the number of trees?

00:08:35.270 --> 00:08:37.830
It seems that you have the wisdom.

00:08:37.830 --> 00:08:46.430
It's a matter of time before you move again.

00:08:46.430 --> 00:08:48.050
NERV?

00:08:48.050 --> 00:08:51.030
Yes, it's a non-profit organization directly affiliated with the United Nations.

00:08:51.030 --> 00:08:53.410
It's where Chi is.

00:08:53.410 --> 00:08:56.400
Well, do you know your father's job?

00:09:00.600 --> 00:09:06.130
I heard from the teacher that it is an important job to protect humanity.

00:09:06.130 --> 00:09:10.680
From now on, the commander of this operation will be you.

00:09:10.680 --> 00:09:12.540
Show me your skills.

00:09:12.540 --> 00:09:13.920
Roger that.

00:09:13.920 --> 00:09:15.170
Ikari-kun.

00:09:15.170 --> 00:09:20.610
Let's admit that we don't have any effective means against the target with our own weapons.

00:09:20.610 --> 00:09:23.540
But can you win?

00:09:23.540 --> 00:09:26.320
I'm NERV for that.

00:09:26.320 --> 00:09:29.160
I'm looking forward to it.

00:09:37.000 --> 00:09:38.900
The NAFTA is going to launch it, huh?

00:09:38.900 --> 00:09:40.630
What are you going to do?

00:09:40.630 --> 00:09:43.640
We're going to launch the first-class aircraft.

00:09:43.640 --> 00:09:44.910
The first-class aircraft, huh?

00:09:44.910 --> 00:09:47.070
We don't have any pilots.

00:09:47.070 --> 00:09:48.440
No problem.

00:09:48.440 --> 00:09:50.580
We'll get another call.

00:09:50.580 --> 00:09:54.230
Are you going to your father's place from now on?

00:09:54.230 --> 00:09:56.020
That's right.

00:09:56.020 --> 00:09:56.910
That's what's going to happen.

00:10:01.180 --> 00:10:04.460
Father...

00:10:04.460 --> 00:10:05.210
That's right.

00:10:05.210 --> 00:10:09.270
Did you get your father's ID card?

00:10:09.270 --> 00:10:11.900
Yes.

00:10:11.900 --> 00:10:13.080
Here you go.

00:10:13.080 --> 00:10:15.730
Thank you.

00:10:15.730 --> 00:10:16.810
Then...

00:10:16.810 --> 00:10:18.850
Read this.

00:10:18.850 --> 00:10:20.960
Nerf?

00:10:20.960 --> 00:10:23.040
Father's job...

00:10:23.040 --> 00:10:27.110
Are you going to do something with me?

00:10:27.110 --> 00:10:28.700
That's right.

00:10:28.700 --> 00:10:30.000
I don't have anything to read, but my father...

00:10:30.000 --> 00:10:33.270
You're not going to send me a letter, are you?

00:10:33.270 --> 00:10:36.180
I see. You're not good at it, Father.

00:10:36.180 --> 00:10:38.840
Just like me.

00:10:38.840 --> 00:10:52.590
This is our secret base.

00:10:52.590 --> 00:10:53.590
The NERV headquarters.

00:10:53.590 --> 00:10:56.000
The key to world reconstruction.

00:10:56.000 --> 00:10:57.970
The place where humanity will be a fortress.

00:11:05.440 --> 00:11:07.700
That's weird...

00:11:07.700 --> 00:11:10.020
I'm sure it's this way.

00:11:10.900 --> 00:11:15.520
This is why it's so hard to get out of here.

00:11:15.520 --> 00:11:18.720
But where did Ritsuko go?

00:11:18.720 --> 00:11:21.210
I'm sorry, I'm not used to it yet.

00:11:21.210 --> 00:11:24.870
I just passed by here.

00:11:24.870 --> 00:11:26.700
But it's okay.

00:11:26.700 --> 00:11:29.220
The system is there to be used.

00:11:39.820 --> 00:11:41.200
I'm shocked.

00:11:41.200 --> 00:11:43.420
You hesitated again, didn't you?

00:11:43.420 --> 00:11:47.570
Hehe.

00:11:47.570 --> 00:11:56.080
What were you doing, Katsuragi Ichi?

00:11:56.080 --> 00:11:58.600
If you're not a human, you don't have time.

00:11:58.600 --> 00:11:59.700
Ehehe, I'm sorry.

00:12:03.450 --> 00:12:04.800
That's the boy, right?

00:12:04.800 --> 00:12:06.050
Yes.

00:12:06.050 --> 00:12:08.040
He's from Marduk's report.

00:12:08.040 --> 00:12:09.740
His name's Sard Children.

00:12:09.740 --> 00:12:11.030
Nice to meet you.

00:12:11.030 --> 00:12:12.750
Oh, yes.

00:12:12.750 --> 00:12:15.680
He's just like his father.

00:12:15.680 --> 00:12:17.960
He's not cute at all.

00:12:17.960 --> 00:12:21.350
I'll leave it to you then.

00:12:21.350 --> 00:12:26.780
It's been three years since we last met.

00:12:26.780 --> 00:12:28.400
Vice Commander.

00:12:28.400 --> 00:12:30.000
The target is...

00:12:30.000 --> 00:12:31.060
It's starting to move.

00:12:31.060 --> 00:12:31.800
Good.

00:12:31.800 --> 00:12:34.570
All units, place the first group at the front.

00:12:34.570 --> 00:12:42.300
This is the most important thing.

00:12:42.300 --> 00:12:45.180
So, what about the first machine?

00:12:45.180 --> 00:12:47.640
It's currently in cooling mode, using the B-type equipment.

00:12:47.640 --> 00:12:49.460
Is it really moving?

00:12:49.460 --> 00:12:51.800
It hasn't moved once yet, has it?

00:12:51.800 --> 00:12:56.780
It has a starting probability of 0.0000001%.

00:12:56.780 --> 00:12:59.700
It's often referred to as the O-9 system.

00:13:00.000 --> 00:13:02.580
Does that mean it won't work?

00:13:02.580 --> 00:13:04.010
Oh, how rude.

00:13:04.010 --> 00:13:05.130
It's not zero.

00:13:05.130 --> 00:13:07.190
It's above the number.

00:13:07.190 --> 00:13:11.560
Well, if it doesn't work anyway, it won't work anymore.

00:13:31.180 --> 00:13:32.880
Even if I looked for it, I couldn't find it.

00:13:32.880 --> 00:13:37.930
The ultimate humanoid combat weapon created by humans.

00:13:37.930 --> 00:13:40.050
Human-made human, Evangelion.

00:13:40.050 --> 00:13:41.800
The first generation of it.

00:13:41.800 --> 00:13:44.420
Construction was carried out by Gokuhiri.

00:13:44.420 --> 00:13:47.070
We humans are the last trump card.

00:13:47.070 --> 00:13:49.060
Is this also your father's work?

00:13:49.060 --> 00:13:49.880
That's right.

00:13:49.880 --> 00:13:53.200
Long time no see.

00:14:00.120 --> 00:14:01.340
Offensive?

00:14:01.340 --> 00:14:05.190
The No. 0 is under siege, isn't it?

00:14:05.190 --> 00:14:08.350
Are you planning to use the No. 1?

00:14:08.350 --> 00:14:09.870
There's no other way.

00:14:09.870 --> 00:14:13.660
Hey! You can't move Rei yet, can you?

00:14:13.660 --> 00:14:16.090
There's no pilot!

00:14:16.090 --> 00:14:18.430
I just got it.

00:14:18.430 --> 00:14:20.530
Really?

00:14:20.530 --> 00:14:21.530
Ikari Shinji-kun.

00:14:21.530 --> 00:14:22.670
Yes?

00:14:22.670 --> 00:14:24.570
You're going to ride it.

00:14:24.570 --> 00:14:25.370
But...

00:14:25.370 --> 00:14:29.780
It took 7 months to synchronize with Ayanami Rei and Ever, didn't it?

00:14:29.780 --> 00:14:30.000
Right now...

00:14:30.090 --> 00:14:32.480
It's impossible for a child who's just a child.

00:14:32.480 --> 00:14:33.810
You just have to sit down.

00:14:33.810 --> 00:14:35.250
I don't want any more of that.

00:14:35.250 --> 00:14:36.440
But...

00:14:36.440 --> 00:14:39.610
Death and destruction are the top priority right now.

00:14:39.610 --> 00:14:40.510
For that,

00:14:40.510 --> 00:14:46.820
There's no other way but to put in a person who you think can be synchronized with Eva.

00:14:46.820 --> 00:14:51.220
I'm sure you know, Katsuragi Ichi.

00:14:51.220 --> 00:14:54.180
That's right.

00:14:54.180 --> 00:14:56.700
Dad, why did you call me?

00:14:56.700 --> 00:14:58.730
Because you're thinking about it.

00:14:58.730 --> 00:15:00.000
Then I'll...

00:15:00.120 --> 00:15:03.380
You want me to fight with the one before me?

00:15:03.380 --> 00:15:04.380
That's right.

00:15:04.380 --> 00:15:05.380
I don't want to do that!

00:15:05.380 --> 00:15:07.550
What are you talking about now?

00:15:07.550 --> 00:15:10.440
Didn't you want me to fight with you?

00:15:10.440 --> 00:15:12.320
I called you because I needed you.

00:15:12.320 --> 00:15:19.170
I can't fight with other people.

00:15:19.170 --> 00:15:21.690
I can't do that.

00:15:21.690 --> 00:15:25.730
I've never seen or heard of it, but I can't do it!

00:15:25.730 --> 00:15:28.940
I'll take your explanation.

00:15:28.940 --> 00:15:30.000
No way!

00:15:31.310 --> 00:15:33.620
I can't do it!

00:15:33.620 --> 00:15:36.460
I can't ride this!

00:15:36.460 --> 00:15:38.650
If you want to ride it, hurry up.

00:15:38.650 --> 00:15:40.080
If you don't come out, go home!

00:16:04.960 --> 00:16:05.890
Get on.

00:16:05.890 --> 00:16:08.340
But...

00:16:08.340 --> 00:16:09.960
Even though I came all the way here...

00:16:09.960 --> 00:16:12.200
There's no way I can do this!

00:16:12.200 --> 00:16:14.750
Shinji-kun...

00:16:14.750 --> 00:16:17.320
Why did you come here?

00:16:17.320 --> 00:16:20.030
You can't run away!

00:16:20.030 --> 00:16:21.220
From your father!

00:16:21.220 --> 00:16:23.110
And above all, from yourself!

00:16:23.110 --> 00:16:24.650
I know!

00:16:24.650 --> 00:16:25.650
But...

00:16:25.650 --> 00:16:27.140
There's no way I can do this!

00:16:35.400 --> 00:16:39.070
Fuyutsuki, wake up Rei.

00:16:39.070 --> 00:16:42.160
He's not dead.

00:16:42.160 --> 00:16:49.590
Rei, you can't use the spare parts.

00:16:49.590 --> 00:16:52.900
One more time.

00:16:52.900 --> 00:16:56.780
Rewrite the initial system to Rei.

00:16:56.780 --> 00:16:57.780
Reboot.

00:16:57.780 --> 00:16:58.560
Roger.

00:16:58.560 --> 00:17:00.000
Stop. Reboot.

00:17:03.200 --> 00:17:06.630
After all, I don't need humans.

00:18:00.000 --> 00:18:01.830
It can't move.

00:18:01.830 --> 00:18:04.830
It's reacting without an interface.

00:18:04.830 --> 00:18:07.290
Rather than that, did you protect him?

00:18:07.290 --> 00:18:08.840
Protect him?

00:18:35.880 --> 00:18:36.710
I can't run away!

00:18:36.710 --> 00:18:38.260
I can't run away!

00:18:38.260 --> 00:18:40.920
I'll do it!

00:18:40.920 --> 00:18:42.190
I'll ride it!

00:18:42.190 --> 00:18:46.710
Over.

00:18:46.710 --> 00:18:48.730
Re-containment complete.

00:18:48.730 --> 00:18:50.730
All docking locations in the cage.

00:18:50.730 --> 00:18:51.510
Roger.

00:18:51.510 --> 00:18:53.170
Stopping signal plan.

00:18:53.170 --> 00:18:54.670
Exhaust complete.

00:18:54.670 --> 00:18:57.300
Three plans included.

00:19:22.910 --> 00:19:26.760
If you are satisfied with the ACL, you will be able to take oxygen directly into your blood.

00:19:32.360 --> 00:19:33.360
I'm sorry.

00:19:33.360 --> 00:19:35.360
Hold it! You're a boy!

00:19:35.360 --> 00:19:36.360
Ah...

00:19:36.360 --> 00:19:40.280
Power power power! All power is on! No problem!

00:19:40.280 --> 00:19:41.280
Roger!

00:19:41.280 --> 00:19:47.160
Second contact. No signal.

00:19:47.160 --> 00:19:51.910
Power is normal. The signal is fixed to the basic Japanese principle.

00:19:51.910 --> 00:19:55.410
All initial contact problems are solved.

00:19:55.410 --> 00:19:57.410
All directions open.

00:19:57.410 --> 00:20:00.000
Synchronization 41.3.

00:20:00.000 --> 00:20:01.320
3%

00:20:01.320 --> 00:20:02.550
This is amazing.

00:20:02.550 --> 00:20:04.970
All harmonics are normal.

00:20:04.970 --> 00:20:06.940
There is no lag.

00:20:06.940 --> 00:20:09.320
I can do this.

00:20:09.320 --> 00:20:12.500
Ready to launch!

00:20:12.500 --> 00:20:13.820
Ready to launch!

00:20:13.820 --> 00:20:15.830
The first kubold has been launched!

00:20:18.300 --> 00:20:20.520
The American bridge is moving!

00:20:20.520 --> 00:20:28.450
The second kubold has been launched!

00:20:28.450 --> 00:20:30.000
The second kubold has been launched!

00:20:34.320 --> 00:20:37.220
Unlock the safety device from 1 to 15.

00:20:37.220 --> 00:20:38.600
Confirmed.

00:20:38.600 --> 00:20:40.680
The current condition of Unit 1 is...

00:20:40.680 --> 00:20:42.390
Internal power, charging.

00:20:42.390 --> 00:20:43.640
Internal power, charging.

00:20:43.640 --> 00:20:44.930
No abnormality.

00:20:44.930 --> 00:20:46.080
Roger that.

00:20:46.080 --> 00:20:48.440
EVA Unit 1 to the vehicle room.

00:21:03.640 --> 00:21:05.460
Clear path clear! All green!

00:21:05.460 --> 00:21:07.110
Preparations complete!

00:21:07.110 --> 00:21:08.840
Roger that!

00:21:08.840 --> 00:21:10.860
You don't mind, do you?

00:21:10.860 --> 00:21:11.860
Of course!

00:21:11.860 --> 00:21:15.510
As long as we don't defeat the Angel, we have no future.

00:21:15.510 --> 00:21:20.040
Ikarin, you really think this is enough?

00:22:00.860 --> 00:22:02.500
Floating

00:23:06.880 --> 00:23:09.880
But it was not the beginning of everything.

00:23:09.880 --> 00:23:11.920
Shinji runs away from his father.

00:23:11.920 --> 00:23:14.920
Misato's arrogance makes him decide to save him.

00:23:14.920 --> 00:23:17.790
Next time, "Unknown battlefield"

00:23:17.790 --> 00:23:19.790
Next time, "Service! Service!"
